---
const stats = [
  { value: '20%+', label: 'Of crypto volume now trades on DEXs' },
  { value: '24/7', label: 'Always-on liquidity provision' },
  { value: '<50ms', label: 'Quote response latency' },
];
---

<section id="about" class="section-padding relative">
  <div class="container-main">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-start">
      <!-- Left -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="label mb-6">About Affine</div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-h2 text-white mb-8">
          Accelerating the Decentralization of Global Markets
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-5 text-body-lg text-steel-300">
          <p>
            Decentralized exchanges have come a long way since the early days of EtherDelta. Today, DEXs account for more than 20% of total crypto trading volume — driven by the rapid rise of platforms like Jupiter and Hyperliquid.
          </p>
          <p>
            Yet despite this progress, decentralized markets still lag behind centralized exchanges when it comes to asset coverage and pricing efficiency.
          </p>
          <p>
            Affine Trading was founded to bridge that gap. We focus on market making within DeFi markets, helping align DEX pricing with CEX benchmarks and driving liquidity where it's needed most.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right — Stats -->
      <div class="reveal lg:pt-16" style="transition-delay: 0.15s;">
        <div class="space-y-0">
          {stats.map((stat, i) => (
            <div class={`py-8 ${i < stats.length - 1 ? 'border-b border-white/[0.06]' : ''}`}>
              <div class="font-heading text-h1 text-white mb-2">{stat.value}</div>
              <div class="text-body text-steel-400">{stat.label}</div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
